# A copy of Tomik (Phantasmal Image) has Tomik's abilities (CR 707.2), so it grants its controller's planeswalkers the cap
# and the grant is the copy's own. Bot2 casts Tomik, then Phantasmal Image copying it, and the legend rule (CR 704.5j) keeps
# the Image and puts the original in the graveyard: only the copy can be the source of the cap on Wrenn and Six, so two
# creatures at Wrenn are refused while one at Wrenn and one at Bot2 is legal.

[Bot1 Deck]
Woodland Changeling
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Tomik, Orzhov Lawmage
Phantasmal Image
Wrenn and Six
Island x20

